      "name": "Visible Minefields",
      "slug": "visible-minefields",
      "teaser": "\"I love invisible minefields!\" - said nobody ever",
      "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/2441.png",
      "downloads": 14018,
      "favourites_count": 1,
      "description": "<h3><strong>THIS MOD IS (SLIGHTLY) UNDERCOOKED, I’M SORRY! -</strong> If you have any suggestions or notice an issue then <strong>let me know</strong>!</h3>\n<h3>This mod only modifies <strong>minefields</strong>. For claymores check out <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/2438-hazardifier\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Hazardifier</a> by <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/user/30839-drakiaxyz/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><strong>DrakiaXYZ</strong></a></h3>\n<h3>Introduction</h3>\n<p>This mod makes all <strong>non-boundary</strong> minefields visible. That’s about it.</p>\n<h3>Performance</h3>\n<p>Since this mod creates up to hundreds of GameObjects it may lead reduced performance. Minefield properties can be changed in mapconfig.json.</p>\n<h3>Preview</h3>\n<h3>Installation</h3>\n<p>Just drag &amp; drop the BepInEx folder into your SPT folder.</p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://i.imgur.com/wByb5Ln.gif\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/wByb5Ln.gif\" alt=\"wByb5Ln.gif\" /></a></p>\n",
